### Flexible Phone Input Handling

Source: https://github.com/catamphetamine/libphonenumber-js/blob/master/_autodocs/configuration.md

Implement flexible phone input handling that supports both national and international formats, with options for extraction and strict validation.

```typescript
import { 
  AsYouType, 
  isValidPhoneNumber 
} from 'libphonenumber-js'

// User can input national or international
function parseFlexible(input, defaultCountry) {
  // Try to parse (extract from text if needed)
  const parsed = parsePhoneNumber(input, {
    defaultCountry,
    extract: true
  })

  return parsed
}

function validateFlexible(input, defaultCountry) {
  // Strict validation
  return isValidPhoneNumber(input, defaultCountry)
}

// Live formatting in input field
const formatter = new AsYouType(defaultCountry)

function onInputChange(newChar) {
  const formatted = formatter.input(newChar)
  updateDisplay(formatted)

  if (formatter.isValid()) {
    showSuccess()
  }
}
```
